sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Public API
    actor Admin
    actor B as Bot
    Admin->>API: login
    activate API
    API-->>Admin: token
    B->>API: poll
    API->>API: queue
    activate API
    API-->>B: 202 Accepted
    deactivate API
    Note left of API: rate limit applies to bots
    deactivate API
    Note over Admin,B: both are actors
    B--)Admin: async ping
    B-xAdmin: cancelled
    Admin-->B: open dashed
